      Qibla compass — short, unambiguous labels only.

      This follows the policy recorded at the top of this file and in app/lint.xml: the strings
      translated here name things (sections, readings, sensors, accuracy levels, buttons and fields),
      and the ones that state what an estimate means, what a reading does not prove, or what Salah
      cannot verify stay in English until they can be reviewed. The Qibla screen's explanatory
      paragraphs, its error explanations and its accuracy-claim wording are therefore untranslated on
      purpose rather than by omission.

      shortcut_qibla is deliberately absent: it is the Qibla screen's own title and the Home and Tools
      tile, and no shortcut_* tile in Salah is translated yet, so translating only this one would make
      one screen's heading the odd one out.
